      <category
        domain="https://www.globenewswire.com/rss/ISIN">NL0000289213</category>
      <title>Wereldhave sells retail park De Mael in Bruges and strengthens balance sheet </title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Wereldhave N.V. (‘Wereldhave’), through Wereldhave Belgium (70% owned by Wereldhave), announces the sale of retail park De Mael in Bruges (Belgium) to a consortium of private investors. The divestment of this non-core asset is in line with Wereldhave's strategy to reduce leverage while focusing its portfolio on Full Service Centers. </b></p>]]></description>
